Integrating a fallback cache to serve the last 5 chatbot responses during GPT-4 API outages is a great way to ensure your chatbot remains responsive even when the primary API is unavailable. Below is an example of how you can implement this in Node.js using Express and a simple in-memory cache.

### Example Implementation

